# 9. HDFS Safe Mode

Safe Mode is a NameNode state during which namespace modifications are restricted.

During startup, NameNode enters Safe Mode while it checks block availability.

Check Safe Mode:

```bash
hdfs dfsadmin -safemode get
```

Enter Safe Mode:

```bash
hdfs dfsadmin -safemode enter
```

Leave Safe Mode:

```bash
hdfs dfsadmin -safemode leave
```

Wait for Safe Mode to end:

```bash
hdfs dfsadmin -safemode wait
```

