# 12. File Upload and Download

## Upload local file to HDFS

```bash
hdfs dfs -put employees.csv /company/employees/
```

Alternative:

```bash
hdfs dfs -copyFromLocal employees.csv /company/employees/
```

## Download file from HDFS

```bash
hdfs dfs -get /company/employees/employees.csv ./
```

Alternative:

```bash
hdfs dfs -copyToLocal /company/employees/employees.csv ./
```

## Upload and overwrite

```bash
hdfs dfs -put -f employees.csv /company/employees/
```

## Upload multiple files

```bash
hdfs dfs -put ~/employee_data/*.csv /company/raw/employees/
```

